[N 15-30 02 Ruins of Lordaeron][GL OFF]
[D RestedXP Forever dungeon quest guides: pick up and complete all quests for one dungeon. Converted from the RestedXP guide for Guidelime.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]You will now run Ruins of Lordaeron \\ All the quests are picked up inside the dungeon
[L 55.5,47.74 Ironforge][TAR1573-]Talk to *Gryth Thurden* \\ If you do not have the Wetlands flight path, skip this step \\ Fly to [F Wetlands]
[OC][G 53.37,35.03,30 Dun Morogh][G 51.25,36.6,30 Dun Morogh][G 45.25,39.71,70 Dun Morogh][G 41.27,38.91,80 Dun Morogh]Follow the lime waypoints in order
[OC][G 37.91,37.7,100 Dun Morogh]Exit Ironforge. Travel to the Dun Morogh -> Wetlands deathskip location \\ (Skip if you are already in Wetlands)
[OC][G 30.74,34.27,15 Dun Morogh][G 30.81,33.55,15 Dun Morogh][G 31.06,32.54,15 Dun Morogh][G 31.44,32.36,15 Dun Morogh][G 31.67,29.64,15 Dun Morogh][G 32.21,28.78,15 Dun Morogh][G 32.64,27.74,15 Dun Morogh][G 32.7,26.32,15 Dun Morogh]Follow the lime waypoints in order
[OC][G 32.7,26.38 Dun Morogh]Climb the mountain, then walk down past the jagged pattern until your zone changes to the Wetlands \\ (Skip if you are already in Menethil Harbor)
[A Softcore][OC][G 31.43,25.32 Dun Morogh]Go to the marked location (Skip if you are already in Menethil Harbor)
[A Softcore][OC][L 31.43,25.32 Dun Morogh][L 11.73,43.3 Wetlands]Jump off the mountain toward the north or north-west \\ Die and respawn at the Baradin Bay *Spirit Healer* \\ (Skip if you are already in Menethil Harbor)[TAR6491-]
[OC][G 10.89,54.78 Wetlands]Swim over to Menethil Harbor
[OC][G 9.49,59.69,35 Wetlands]Go to the Menethil Harbor flight master.
[G 9.49,59.69 Wetlands]Talk to *Shellei Brondir* \\ Get the Wetlands flight path [P Menethil Harbor] \\ (Skip if you are already in Hillsbrad Foothills: tick it off) \\ (Skip if you are already in Ruins of Lordaeron: tick it off)[TAR1571-]
[OC][G 4.65,57.12 Wetlands]Take the boat to Southshore
[G 49.34,52.27 Hillsbrad Foothills]Talk to *Darla Harris* \\ Get the [P Southshore] flight path \\ (Skip if you are already in Ruins of Lordaeron: tick it off)[TAR2432-]
[OC][G 34.81,30.44,100 Hillsbrad Foothills][G 25.53,82.83,130 Alterac Mountains][G 26.36,66.58,150 Alterac Mountains][G 29.93,36.83,100 Alterac Mountains][G 66.96,76.58,70 Tirisfal Glades][G 67.61,72,20 Tirisfal Glades][G 68.38,71.22,10 Tirisfal Glades][G 68.35,68.31,15 Tirisfal Glades][G 66.99,67.92,25 Tirisfal Glades][G 67.03,66.06,10 Tirisfal Glades][G 66.17,0.9,20 Undercity]Follow the lime waypoints in order
[OC][L 37.61,43.87 Hillsbrad Foothills]NOTE: You may encounter higher level *Lions* and *Bears* on the way to the Hillsbrad Fields \\ Be careful of Horde players if you are on a PVP server
[G 73.22,11.44,20 Undercity]Travel to the Ruins of Lordaeron in Undercity. Enter the dungeon \\ Be careful of high level *Lions*, *Bears*, *Spiders* or *Murlocs* as you run over \\ As soon as you enter Undercity you will be automatically PVP flagged, becoming attackable by *Horde* \\ Open Edit guide and copy the full URL for a video guide on how to enter the Ruins of Lordaeon dungeon: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jxmG6_JPFMc
Talk to *Captain Truman* \\ Accept [QA95250 Abominable Creatures]
[OC]Kill *The Baron*. Loot him for the *Head of the Baron* \\ [QC95250,1 Abominable Creatures]
Loot all mobs for the *Bloodied Insignia* \\ Use the *Bloodied Insignia* to start the quest \\ Accept [QA95195 Bloodied Insignia][UI268535-] \\ Once you accept, keep looting insignias from the other mobs as you clear the dungeon.
[O]Loot the *Crest of Lordaeron* on the ground or hanging on a wall \\ Keep an eye out for this. It can spawn in many different locations and be hard to see \\ Use the *Crest of Lordaeron* to start the quest \\ Accept [QA95189 Crest of Lordaeron][UI268579-]
[O]Click the *Crumpled Paper* on the ground near *Rath'mael* \\ You can do this after you've killed him \\ Accept [QA92415 Remember That I Love You]
Finish this before you go on \\ Loot all mobs for their *Bloodied Insignias* \\ [QC95195,1 Bloodied Insignia] \\ Kill *The Baron* and loot his head \\ [QC95250,1 Abominable Creatures]
[A Softcore][OC][G 73.22,11.44,15 Undercity]Die to any mobs inside to get back to the start of the instance faster. The graveyard is right outside the instance portal \\ Do NOT spirit res! Run back as a *Ghost* into the instance portal
Talk to *Captain Truman* \\ *Captain Truman* is back at the start of the dungeon \\ Turn in [QT95250 Abominable Creatures]
[OC]Travel to Stormwind City
[G 69.18,82.73 Stormwind City]Talk to *General Marcus Jonathan* \\ Turn in [QT95195 Bloodied Insignia]
[O][L 70.22,31.34 Stormwind City][L 68.6,28.19 Stormwind City]Go to the Stormwind Library and seek out *Lady Dena Kennedy* in the Royal Gallery \\ She walks around slightly in the Royal Gallery \\ Turn in [QT95189 Crest of Lordaeron]
[O][L 56.32,53.98 Stormwind City]Talk to *Orphan Matron Nightingale* \\ Turn in [QT92415 Remember That I Love You] \\ Accept [QA95161 Remember That I Love You]
[OC][L 73.28,44.76 Duskwood]The final quest you have now "Remember That I Love You" is turned in at Darkshire, in Duskwood. It only rewards 180XP and Neck piece. Either turn that in now or at a later time when you're in Duskwood \\ Skip this step if you wish to do it later \\ Turn in [QT95161 Remember That I Love You]
